OL,3,GNEWSAHazardous waste incinerator minded
OL,4,Afor approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Environment Agency (EA) has
OL,7,Fannounced its intention to approve a
OL,8,Fpermit for a hazardous waste
OL,9,Fincinerator plant which attracted
OL,10,Fthousands of objections.
OL,12,FThe structure on Heighington Lane in
OL,13,FNewton Aycliffe, County Durham, has
OL,14,Falready been built by Fornax North East
OL,15,Fbut requires additional building work
OL,16,Fand an environmental permit from the
OL,17,FEA.
OL,19,FThe EA said after exploring the issues
OL,20,Fand concerns raised, it could not find
OL,21,Fany reason to refuse the application
OL,22,Fbut was yet to make a final decision.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
